{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"1768","name":"纯水之愿","desc":"1.4小活动","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/04/08/76078930/0eb95b3d45243eaf5316e77dc2ded2d4_2168031483869657711.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"活动说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e活动期间，旅行者可以装备「好奇的嫣朵拉」捕获指定区域内的幻形生物，推进探索进度，并完成剧情任务，可获取\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e活动纪念装饰小道具「嫣朵拉」、「纯水真心」、原石\u003c/span\u003e等奖励。成功挑战活动关卡「洛蒂娅的愤怒」后，可使用「纯水真心」或原粹树脂获得\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e角色经验素材\u003c/span\u003e等奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e2021/04/09 10:00 ~ 2021/04/16 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动参与条件〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥20级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e● 活动期间，完成「潺潺向前 · 其一」任务，可获得活动小道具「好奇的嫣朵拉」，装备后可在指定区域进行探索，使用特殊技能捕获幻形生物，推进探索进度。完成指定区域的探索后，可获得道具「纯水真心」。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1317","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动奖励","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/04/08/76078930/8b46cdab55f4819602e4b6a400d450ef_1797435271929922343.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1318","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"玩法说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e蒙德璃月交界处的水域毫无征兆的变苦了。这样下去的话，蒙德酒业可能会面临灭顶之灾… \u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e活动期间，旅行者可以装备「好奇的嫣朵拉」捕获指定区域内的幻形生物，推进探索进度，并完成剧情任务，可获取活动纪念装饰小道具「嫣朵拉」、「纯水真心」、原石等奖励。成功挑战活动关卡「洛蒂娅的愤怒」后，可使用「纯水真心」或原粹树脂获得角色经验素材等奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓玩法说明〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e★嫣朵拉的学习\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e完成前置任务「潺潺向前 · 其一」任务后，可获得活动限时小道具「好奇的嫣朵拉」。随时间推进，将逐步解锁探索区域。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e在背包中装备「好奇的嫣朵拉」后，可以在探索的区域召唤「好奇的嫣朵拉」。但如果不在探索区域内，「好奇的嫣朵拉」也许不会回应召唤。       \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/01/75276545/c24db6c482465838958216aeb4a2fd1b_3446571324216804615.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(244, 244, 244);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e装备嫣朵拉后，旅行者的元素战技会被替换为嫣朵拉的吐泡泡技能。旅行者可以根据当前需要切换技能。    \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/01/75276545/c126498af8430d396b2b9199cd5b552f_5138804011835664796.gif?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,gif\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(244, 244, 244);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e使用吐泡泡技能可以将敌人困住，长按技能可以调整施放距离。   \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/01/75276545/41f68cc2ce0ff6a7d43138ab5117dff2_1545659286968617045.gif?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,gif\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(244, 244, 244);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e适当利用冰元素，可以更有效率地捕捉纯水动物。当泡泡困住纯水动物时，嫣朵拉可将其吸收融合，吸收融合后区域探索进度会相应增长。当完成探索时，可以获得当前区域的奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e*提示：\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(25,67,156,1)\\\"\u003e直接击杀\u003c/span\u003e纯水动物\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(25,67,156,1)\\\"\u003e无法推进探索进度\u003c/span\u003e哦~     \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/01/75276545/a5e7c4e9abbae77859d376e9c9f96afa_5691801011265138517.gif?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,gif\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(244, 244, 244);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/01/75276545/840788910ff6b7099b64357913e665dc_5470141580660385584.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(244, 244, 244);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e完成指定区域的探索后，可获得道具「纯水真心」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e★\u003cstrong\u003e洛蒂娅的愤怒 \u003c/strong\u003e    \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/01/75276545/782b436608fae9290f93e13ac3cc7734_549878100289359224.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(244, 244, 244);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e 活动期间，纯水精灵将追加挑战活动关卡「洛蒂娅的愤怒」，旅行者可以自主选择挑战纯水精灵或活动关卡。活动挑战开启后，将进入特殊挑战模式，\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(25,67,156,1)\\\"\u003e无法暂停游戏或进行传送\u003c/span\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e特定角色在挑战中，水元素抗性和元素充能效率都将有所提升。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e在战斗中，洛蒂娅会使用全新方式进行战斗。   \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/01/75276545/e4c084f3e6d44c73829b6e885a9af134_5848234425816415358.gif?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,gif\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(244, 244, 244);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e战斗时，场地中将出现\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(25,67,156,1)\\\"\u003e间歇激流\u003c/span\u003e，合理利用间歇激流可以避开攻击伤害。       \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/04/01/75276545/961683b9a60d51727dfba58d68e620a0_5450704356598972724.gif?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,gif\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(244, 244, 244);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e成功完成挑战后使用「纯水真心」或原粹树脂获得\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e角色经验素材\u003c/span\u003e等奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1319","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"moduleName\":\"\",\"layout_\":\"left\",\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\"]}]}","style":""}],"id":"1320","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1321","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1323","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"d